  "sourceSummary": "North Bristol NHS Therapy eRehab Lower Limb Co-ordination, Video5 Toe tapping: seated with flat, step or cup targets, gently tap foot onto target, arms and back unsupported. Leeds NHS LN003869p13 Toe tapping: alternate forward steps, seated modification permitted. This seated flat-floor version alternates legs every4seconds with a brief toe touch. Source does not specify exact ankle angle, distance or8second cycle.",
